#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:2
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用指南"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"ResourcePackServer hosts ``.zip`` resource pack files over HTTP. Minecraft c"
"lients can download packs via the ``resource-pack`` field in ``server.proper"
"ties``."
msgstr ""
"ResourcePackServer 通过 HTTP 托管 ``.zip`` 资源包文件。Minecraft 客户端可通过 ``server.prope"
"rties`` 中的 ``resource-pack`` 字段下载资源包。"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:7
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:9
msgid "**1. Prepare your packs**"
msgstr "**1. 准备你的资源包**"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"Place ``.zip`` resource pack files in a directory (default: ``./resource_pac"
"ks``):"
msgstr "将 ``.zip`` 资源包文件放入一个目录（默认: ``./resource_packs``）："

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:20
msgid "**2. Start the server**"
msgstr "**2. 启动服务器**"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:26
msgid "**3. Browse the pack list**"
msgstr "**3. 浏览资源包列表**"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:28
msgid ""
"Open ``http://localhost:8080/`` in a browser. You'll see a table of all pack"
"s with their SHA1 hashes."
msgstr "在浏览器中打开 ``http://localhost:8080/``。你会看到一个包含所有资源包及其 SHA1 哈希的表格。"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:30
msgid "**4. Configure Minecraft**"
msgstr "**4. 配置 Minecraft**"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:32
msgid "Edit ``server.properties``:"
msgstr "编辑 ``server.properties``："

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:39
msgid ""
"The merged pack combines all your packs into one zip. See :doc:`/contents/co"
"nfig/index` for merge options."
msgstr "合并包将所有资源包合并为一个 zip 文件。合并选项参见 :doc:`/contents/config/index`。"

