#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:84
msgid "Merged Pack"
msgstr "合并包"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:86
msgid ""
"Minecraft only accepts **one** resource pack URL. ResourcePackServer solves "
"this by merging multiple packs into a single ``merged.zip``, available at ``"
"/merged.zip``."
msgstr ""
"Minecraft 只接受**一个**资源包 URL。ResourcePackServer 通过将多个包合并为一个 ``merged.zip`` 来解决"
"此问题，合并包位于 ``/merged.zip``。"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:88
msgid ""
"Packs are merged in **priority order** (configurable via ``--priority`` or t"
"he config file)"
msgstr "资源包按**优先级顺序**合并（可通过 ``--priority`` 或配置文件配置）"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:89
msgid "Higher-priority packs **override** lower-priority ones on file-level"
msgstr "高优先级包会在文件级别**覆盖**低优先级包"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:90
msgid "The ``pack.mcmeta`` description combines all pack descriptions"
msgstr "``pack.mcmeta`` 的描述字段会合并所有包的描述"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:91
msgid "The ``pack.png`` icon is taken from the highest-priority pack that has one"
msgstr "``pack.png`` 图标取自具有该文件的最高优先级包"

#: ../../source/contents/usage/index.rst:92
msgid ""
"The merged pack is **cached** and automatically regenerated when any source "
"pack changes"
msgstr "合并包会被**缓存**，当任何源包更改时会自动重新生成"

